# Publish

After a requested change to this app is done and checked, commit it and push `main` so GitHub Pages deploys. Do this without waiting to be asked again.

- Commit message says why the change was made.
- Do not commit secrets, and do not force-push.
- Push only this repo unless the portfolio listing changed too.
